      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "<b>Moraxella catarrhalis (Gram-negative)</b>\r\n\r\n<b>Brief Characteristics:</b>\r\n\r\n-
    Gram-negative diplococci\r\n\r\n- Produces \u03B2-lactamase\r\n\r\n<b>Habitat:</b>\r\n\r\n-
    Upper respiratory tract\r\n\r\n<b>Major Diseases:</b>\r\n\r\n- Otitis media\r\n\r\n-
    Sinusitis\r\n\r\n- Acute exacerbations of COPD\r\n\r\n- Bronchitis\r\n\r\n<b>Effective
    Antibiotics:</b>\r\n\r\n- Amoxicillin\u2013clavulanate\r\n\r\n- Cefixime / Ceftriaxone\r\n\r\n-
    Azithromycin\r\n\r\n- Levofloxacin\r\n\r\n- Ciprofloxacin\r\n"
