  m_text: Escherichia coli is introduced in the game as a deceptive enemy that normally
    exists in balance but turns dangerous when it crosses forbidden boundaries. Once
    it escapes its usual territory, it unleashes powerful toxins that disrupt vital
    systems, causing chaos and rapid damage from within. This enemy spreads quickly
    through contaminated paths, overwhelming defenses before they can fully respond.
    Unpredictable and versatile, Escherichia coli symbolizes how familiar forces
    can become deadly threats when order is broken and control is lost.
