      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "MSSA\u2013Methicillin Sensitive Staphylococcus aureus appears in the game
    as a versatile and aggressive enemy that exploits close contact and exposed weaknesses.
    It enters through small wounds, multiplies rapidly, and releases damaging toxins.
    Though it seems manageable at first, it can quickly escalate into severe infections
    if ignored. Adaptable and relentless, it overwhelms the battlefield with pressure.
    Staphylococcus aureus teaches players not to underestimate common enemies."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 087cf7f99bbb7214b899e6e08cbaacee, type: 2}
